@startuml TimelineEditorEditSequence
title Dionysus Timeline Editor - Edit, Validate, Render and Undo
autonumber
actor User
participant "Timeline UI" as UI
participant "Command Dispatcher" as Cmd
participant "Command Validator" as Validator
participant "Composition Store" as Store
participant "Undo / Redo History" as History
participant Renderer
participant "Preview / Canvas" as Preview

User -> UI : Drag / trim / split / insert / transform
UI -> Cmd : typed command + target IDs
Cmd -> Validator : validate(command, current state)
alt Valid command
  Validator --> Cmd : accepted
  Cmd -> History : record inverse + history boundary
  Cmd -> Store : apply transaction atomically
  Store -> Renderer : composition revision changed
  Renderer -> Preview : render current playhead
  Preview --> User : updated visual result
else Invalid command
  Validator --> Cmd : rejection + reason
  Cmd --> UI : rejected command
  UI --> User : preserve prior state and explain
end

User -> UI : Undo
UI -> History : request inverse command
History -> Cmd : dispatch inverse
Cmd -> Validator : validate(inverse, current state)
Validator --> Cmd : accepted / rejected
Cmd -> Store : apply inverse if accepted
Store -> Renderer : render restored revision
@enduml
